# Portfolio Website Prototype

## About the Project

This project is a prototype of my personal portfolio website, designed to showcase my skills, creativity, and projects in web development and design.

## Features

- Modern and clean user interface
- Responsive layout
- Personal introduction and skills section
- Portfolio projects showcase
- Contact section

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Flexbox

## Purpose

The goal of this project is to practice front-end development, improve my design skills, and build a professional online presence.

